snippet.description:
The Story of the Kowakujo Cheating Controversy...

The Kowakujo zombies launch served up arguably the most dramatic and controversial event in the almost 18 YEAR history of the mode. The record-breaking Easter Egg hunt stumped the game’s best players for almost 60 hours before it was ultimately consumed by a cheating controversy like we’ve never seen before. Today we will piece together exactly how these chaotic three days played out, unraveling how each of the complex steps were solved, investigating the truth behind the foul play and uncovering a controversy that extends way beyond Kowakujo itself. Enjoy!

